From: mira <mira@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 30 May 2026 03:23:19 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] [feature](be) add native stack stub collector

native_stack_collect.cpp is the one-file swap point: the common build ships a
stub that returns the response shape with no PCs, and each variant patch
(fp-walk, ck-phdr-unwind, ...) rewrites only this file with its real collector.

Reference: docs/phase2-design.md "Common API" -> stub collect().
---
 .../http/action/native_stack_collect.cpp      | 43 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 43 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 be/src/service/http/action/native_stack_collect.cpp

diff --git a/be/src/service/http/action/native_stack_collect.cpp b/be/src/service/http/action/native_stack_collect.cpp
new file mode 100644
index 00000000000..deb904498ee
--- /dev/null
+++ b/be/src/service/http/action/native_stack_collect.cpp
@@ -0,0 +1,43 @@
